# Build context for runner/Dockerfile is the repo root (it compiles the
# pillbox binary in-image). Keep the context small: Cargo.* + src/ +
# runner scripts are COPYed, so exclude the heavy/irrelevant dirs but keep
# the entrypoint, package installer and Prime profile probe (excluding all of
# runner/ broke the build because the Dockerfile COPYs them).
target/
.git/
.github/
docs/
tests/
runner/*
!runner/entrypoint.sh
!runner/install-codex-package.sh
!runner/prime-text-profile.py
.claude/
*.md
.env*
